    <tu creationdate="20211010T145037Z" creationid="DESKTOP-77DJ777\Katerina" changedate="20211010T145820Z" changeid="DESKTOP-77DJ777\Katerina" lastusagedate="20211010T145820Z">
      <prop type="x-Context">-1022783187233837023, 5847399472134508597</prop>
      <prop type="x-Origin">TM</prop>
      <prop type="x-ConfirmationLevel">Translated</prop>
      <tuv xml:lang="en-GB">
        <seg>However, the extent to which BZP was implicated in the deaths is not known as in all cases other substances or other circumstances were involved.</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv xml:lang="mk-MK">
        <seg>Сепак, не е познат степенот до кој БЗП биле причината за смртните случаи, бидејќи во сите случаи биле вклучени други супстанции или други околности.</seg>
      </tuv>
      <prop type="x-CELEX">32008D0206</prop>
      <prop type="x-SourceTUIndex">23</prop>
      <prop type="x-MK2Provenance">final dry run accepted clean HIGH</prop>
